```
$ jci-audit check -h
PR/dev gate: cargo-deny policy plus a live cargo-audit scan

Usage: jci-audit check [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --manifest-path <MANIFEST_PATH>  Path to the Cargo.toml (or its directory) to check [default: .]
  -v, --verbose...                     Increase logging verbosity
      --deny-warnings                  Fail if the tools report any warning
  -q, --quiet...                       Decrease logging verbosity
  -h, --help                           Print help (see more with '--help')

$ jci-audit check --help
PR/dev gate: cargo-deny policy plus a live cargo-audit scan.

Both blocking. Aggregates exit codes and surfaces stderr.

Usage: jci-audit check [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --manifest-path <MANIFEST_PATH>
          Path to the Cargo.toml (or its directory) to check
          
          [default: .]

  -v, --verbose...
          Increase logging verbosity

      --deny-warnings
          Fail if the tools report any warning

  -q, --quiet...
          Decrease logging verbosity

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

```
